{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53783","headline":"采石墓 · 白居易","name":"采石墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采石江边李白坟，遶田无限草连云。\n可怜荒壠泉骨，曾有惊天动地文。\n但是诗人多薄命，就中沦落不过君。\n渚苹溪草犹堪荐，大雅遗风不可闻。\n（见《采石志》，转录自《李白在安徽》）（按：《全唐诗》卷四四○收本诗，缺末二句，今重录。\n今人或谓末二句系人僞托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}